7ef4dc2f1099144368d4a5fc6.mp4?t=1768779217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jet Jitters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Micro Thruster</strong> - A jury-rigged jetpack gives a heartbeat of thrust, just enough to rescue you or send you spiraling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel on Fumes</strong> - The tank empties in seconds. Refills are scarce and never convenient.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last-Chance Heroics</strong> - Fire the thruster at the perfect millisecond to salvage free-fall panic or stretch your flight by a few humbling meters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.poster.avif?t=1768779217\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.webm?t=1768779217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.mp4?t=1768779217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obstacles With Issues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge moving walls that track your hops, swinging wrecking hammers, cannons that treat you like target practice. Everything here craves a cardboard casserole. Outsmart them or taste defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.poster.avif?t=1768779217\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.webm?t=1768779217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.mp4?t=1768779217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogo a cardboard man through madness, blast that jetpack on fumes, and punch gravity where it hurts. Suit up - cereal boxes and all. Go solo or bring friends for multiplayer climbing chaos. See you at the summit... if the duct tape holds.</p>","developers":["Bruder Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/7a4394cb6d68802060b1c4860c2f3be3c7855359/header.jpg?t=1768779217","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902930/2885225/c256321b6caa16a5e060def33398f5234df3455b/1768333905/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768334867","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902930/2885225/c256321b6caa16a5e060def33398f5234df3455b/1768333905/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768334867","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902930/2885225/c256321b6caa16a5e060def33398f5234df3455b/1768333905/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768334867","id":257264316,"name":"Pogo Panic - Multiplayer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257264316/632bd4c2a0855ccf3c8a7f7ec637b14bf7536d29/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768334867"}],"name":"Pogo Panic","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4460 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce G